    "en": {
      "name": "Amazoness Spellcaster - Forbidden Spell Dance",
      "effect": "If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can add 1 \"Amazoness\" monster from your Deck to your hand, except a Level 3 monster. During your Main Phase: You can Fusion Summon 1 EARTH or WIND Fusion Monster from your Extra Deck, using monsters from your hand or field. During damage calculation, if your \"Amazoness\" monster battles an opponent's monster: You can banish this card from your GY; switch the battling monsters' ATK until the end of this turn. You can only use each effect of \"Amazoness Spellcaster - Forbidden Spell Dance\" once per turn.",
